msgid ""
"Drivers should call this function before populating a new statistics block "
"content."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../driver-api/media/v4l2-isp:49: ../include/media/v4l2-isp.h:146
msgid ""
"Returns a pointer to the next available location in **buf**, or an error "
"pointer if the requested **block_size** is not available in **buf** or "
"**block_type** is not valid."
msgstr ""
